==English==
{{was wotd|2018|June|7}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|sco|stalwart}}, a variant of {{der|en|en|stalworth}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}, from {{inh|en|enm|stal-worth||physically strong, hardy, robust; brave, courageous}}, from {{inh|en|ang|stǣlwierþe||able to stand in good stead, serviceable}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=stal-worth, adj.|id=MED42606|accessdate=13 March 2018}}</ref> probably from {{m|ang|staþol||establishment; foundation}} (ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*steh₂-||to stand (up)}}) or {{m|ang|stǣl||place; condition, stead}} + {{m|ang|-wierþe||''suffix meaning ‘able to, capable of’''}} (probably ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*wert-||to rotate, turn}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈstɔːlwət/|/ˈstɒl-/|lang=en}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/ˈstɔlwɚt/|/ˈstɑl-/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|stal|wart|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[firmly|Firmly]] or [[solidly]] [[built#Adjective|built]].
#* {{RQ:Twain Roughing It|chapter=LVII|page=415|passage=For observe, it was an assemblage of two hundred thousand ''young'' men—not simpering, dainty, kid-gloved weaklings, but '''stalwart''', muscular, dauntless young braves, brimful of push and energy, and royally endowed with every attribute that goes to make up a peerless and magnificent manhood—the very pick and choice of the world's glorious ones.}}
#* {{quote-journal|author=Willa Sibert Cather|authorlink=Willa Cather|title=[[w:The Bohemian Girl (short story)|The Bohemian Girl]]|magazine=[[w:McClure's|McClure’s Magazine]]|location=[New York, N.Y.]|publisher=McClure Publications|month=August|year=1912|volume=XXXIX|number=4|section=chapter I|page=422|pageurl=https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015028736356;view=1up;seq=434|oclc=19132586|passage=The driver was a '''stalwart''' woman who sat at ease in the front seat and drove her car bare-headed. She left a cloud of dust and a trail of gasoline behind her.}}
#* {{quote-video|writer={{w|Aaron Ehasz}}|role=Morbo|episode={{w|Crimes of the Hot}}|title={{w|Futurama}}|season=5|number=1|network={{w|Fox Broadcasting Company}}|date=10 November 2002|passage=Direct your attention now to the African turtles seen here migrating&nbsp;… Morbo wishes these '''stalwart''' nomads peace.}}
# [[courageous|Courageous]].

